{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772728392,"nonce":"oy4aArEzE6A48g4JXEw+S0IbBn0=","title":"Console tab overhaul: reconnect, overlay, SSE events, xterm rendering","message":"Comprehensive fix for Chat/Console tab issues:\n\n1. Reconnect button does not restart PTY (only opens new WS) — needs POST /restart before WS open\n2. Reconnect overlay covers ViewToggle/header — user cannot switch views when disconnected\n3. Missing SSE subscriptions: backend emits session:exit/started/stopped/deleted, frontend only handles session:created/updated/ended\n4. xterm rendering glitches: no lineHeight set (default 1.0 too tight), container padding fights fit\n5. Buffer backstop key mismatch: backend returns {data:} but frontend reads data.buffer\n6. createConsoleSession for operator type missing is_operator:true in request body\n7. handleReconnect duplicates entire WS setup code outside main effect (use reconnectNonce instead)\n8. Rich view empty on session crash: no event persistence for historical stream events\n\nPrior attempt (bug f7fbcaf, commit 18e10e3): fixed SSE shape mismatches, response normalization, stale closures, HTTP backstop. That is all working. These are new/remaining issues.","files":null}]}